  // HOW TO ACTIVATE THE MODEL (one-time):
  //   1. Open VS Code in this workspace.
  //   2. Command Palette -> "Chat: Manage Language Models".
  //   3. Confirm "9router (local :20128)" / "fable-5" appears; if not,
  //      paste the contents of .vscode/chatLanguageModels.json via
  //      "Add Models" -> "Custom Endpoint" (or "Update API Key" to set apiKey).
  //   4. In Chat, open the model picker and select "fable-5 (9router :20128)".
  //
  // TO USE THE CUSTOM AGENT:
  //   Chat -> select "Local" harness -> run "/9router — fable-5" or use
  //   "Chat: Run Prompt" and choose .vscode/prompts/9router-agent.prompt.md.
  //
  // NOTE: If your 9router listens on a path other than /v1/chat/completions,
  // update the "url" in .vscode/chatLanguageModels.json accordingly.
